sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Household member
  participant W as OnboardingPage<br/>(wizard)
  participant LS as localStorage
  participant C as OnboardingController
  participant SV as OnboardingService
  participant R as OnboardingRepository
  participant DB as SQLite
  loop steps 1–2: household name, categories
    U->>W: fills step
    W->>C: POST …/validate-household or …/validate-categories
    C-->>W: 204 (no write) or 400
    W->>LS: save draft (name, categories)
  end
  U->>W: fills first account, submits
  W->>C: POST …/validate-accounts
  C-->>W: 204 or 400
  Note over W,LS: account fields are not in the draft
  W->>C: POST /api/households/onboarding
  C->>SV: onboard(userId, input)
  SV->>SV: 409 if user already has a household,<br/>build* validates domain values
  SV->>R: create(household, owner, categories, accounts)
  R->>DB: db.batch([household, household_member,<br/>category…, finance_account…])
  Note over R,DB: one SQLite transaction (ADR-3):<br/>all rows or none
  DB-->>R: committed
  R-->>SV: household
  SV-->>C: household
  C-->>W: 201 household DTO
  W->>LS: clear draft
  W-->>U: navigate to Home
